# Generated from the OSRS Wiki page "Transcript:Tower of Life" by tools/quests/transcript_to_dialogue.py
0	section	Getting started
0	section	The builders on strike
1	line	Player	Hi. Interesting building you have here.
1	line	Player	What's it for?
1	line	Effigy	You like it? It's simply fabulous, isn't it? A real marvel of modern design made just for my fellow alchemists and I!
1	line	Player	I see some builders over there. So I assume it's not yet finished.
1	line	Effigy	What a keen eye this chap has! But imagine this: a gargantuan cylinder of expert design, incorporating an inventive inner spiral walkway to multiple planes of wondrous inhabitance!
1	line	Player	So, it's a tower.
1	line	Effigy	Oh, no, no, no, no.
1	line	Effigy	It's going to have a use that will change this world!
1	line	Effigy	Or at least it would if we could ever get it finished.
1	line	Effigy	See those builders?
1	line	Player	They don't seem to be building much.
1	line	Effigy	Exactly.
1	line	Effigy	They've gone on strike for some petty reason about the tower being too weird. I really can't understand those men.
1	line	Player	Shame.
1	line	Effigy	Hey! Maybe you could talk to them?
1	line	Effigy	You look like a sturdy chap.
1	line	Effigy	Maybe you could finish the work?
1	line	Player	Me?
1	line	Effigy	Come on! This is the chance of a lifetime!
1	select	Start the Tower of Life quest?
1	option	Yes.
2	line	Player	Sure, why not.
2	line	Effigy	That's fantastic! Oh, I'm so pleased.
2	line	Player	Calm down. I'm not making any promises.
2	line	Effigy	Oh, I have a good feeling about this.
2	line	Effigy	Right.
2	line	Effigy	Go have a word with Bonafido the head builder. See if you can't get him off his backside to do some work. Oh, and I'm Effigy by the way.
2	line	Player	Nice to meet you Effigy, I'm {player}. Hold on and I'll see what I can do!
2	cond	If the player has completed Making History:
3	line	Effigy	Wait a minute.
3	line	Effigy	Don't I recognise you from somewhere?
3	line	Player	Erm, do you?
3	line	Effigy	Do you know the outpost north of Ardougne?
3	line	Player	Ah, yes, it's now a small museum. Jorral's looking after it. He's really making history with that place.
3	line	Effigy	Well, the King was going to make that into an alchemy lab for us, but some fool ruined our plans!
3	line	Player	Ah, yes. Shame. Got to go. Bye.
3	line	Effigy	Hey, wait up!
3	line	Player	Best I go sort out this tower. Bye.
2	action	end
1	option	No.
2	line	Player	Sorry, feeling a bit ill today.
2	line	Effigy	A bit ill?
2	line	Effigy	That's a weak excuse for a very feeble personality.
2	action	end
0	section	Talking to Effigy again
1	line	Player	Guess what!
1	line	Effigy	What?
1	line	Player	I'm a fully-fledged builder!
1	line	Effigy	Marvellous! So you can bring this tower to life!
1	line	Player	I'm not sure about that, but I'll take a look and see what I can do.
1	line	Effigy	Oh, what a wondrous person you are!
1	action	end
