0	section	Talking to 'Currency' the Alchemist before starting
1	line	Player	This is quite the tower.
1	line	Currency	Yeah, it cost a fair bit.
1	line	Player	How much?
1	line	Currency	Well, I had to 'alch' a fair few belongings of my fellow alchemists to afford it.
1	line	Player	I bet they love you for that.
1	line	Currency	Everyone loves someone that can create money.
1	line	Player	I don't.
1	action	end
0	section	Talking to 'Currency' the Alchemist
1	line	Player	Hi. Sorry, but why do they call you 'Currency'?
1	line	Currency	That's down to my interest in all things of monetary value.
1	line	Player	You must be pretty rich then.
1	line	Currency	I wish. And I was, up until recently.
1	line	Player	What happened?
1	line	Currency	This tower. Set me back a fair few million.
1	line	Player	I'll bet! It pleases you, then, to know that I have just become a builder and have been granted permission to go mess around inside.
1	line	Currency	This is not a good day for me.
1	action	end
0	section	Speaking with Bonafido, the head builder
1	line	Player	Are you Bonafido by any chance?
1	line	Bonafido	That I am, mate.
1	line	Bonafido	How can I be of assistance?
1	line	Player	Well, I've just spoken to Effigy about this tower. He tells me he hired you to work but you're on strike. Something about an extended tea break?
1	line	Bonafido	Extended cup o' char? E's got it all wrong, mate. We know those alchemi-whatsits are up ta somefin' weird in building this tower, wot wiv all the machinery, and until we get some answers we're not movin a muscle.
1	line	Player	Well, he wanted me to do something about it.
1	line	Player	Is there no way I can convince you to continue?
1	line	Bonafido	Sorry, mate.
1	line	Player	Well, can I at least have a look inside the tower?
1	line	Bonafido	Only builders are allowed in there, like. You don't look like much ov a builder to me.
1	line	Player	I take offence at that! Give me a chance; you may be surprised.
1	line	Bonafido	Okay. Come to me kitted out like a builder - hard hat, some boots, scruffy trousers and shirt - and I'll let ya try out ta be one ov us.
1	line	Player	Count me in!
1	action	end
