0	section	Obtaining Hard hat
1	line	Player	Say, that's a nice helmet.
1	line	Black-eye	Why, thanks.
1	line	Player	I was just wondering if you might be able to help me out with one?
1	line	Black-eye	Always glad to help a budding builder.
1	line	Black-eye	But first, prove your Construction knowledge by answering some questions.
1	line	Black-eye	How many nails does it take to make a rocking chair?
1	option	One
2	line	Player	One?
2	line	Black-eye	One? How do you suppose to use a single nail?
2	action	end
1	option	Five
2	line	Player	Five?
2	line	Black-eye	Nope. Keep guessing!
2	action	end
1	option	Three
2	line	Player	Three?
2	line	Black-eye	Bingo! Okay, now what takes 3 planks, 3 cloths and 3 nails to make, and helps remove light from a room?
2	option	Torn curtains
3	line	Player	Torn curtains?
3	line	Black-eye	Nice one. Last question: I like fish and I want to put some in my garden, but I need a special water feature. What materials would I require?
3	option	8 clay pieces and 3 limestone bricks
4	line	Player	8 clay pieces and 3 limestone bricks?
4	line	Black-eye	Oh, and you were so close!
4	action	end
3	option	10 clay pieces
4	line	Player	10 clay pieces?
4	line	Black-eye	That's it! You seem to know your stuff. I got a spare helmet from a builder that died on... I mean, err, had to leave the job for greener pastures.
4	line	Player	Greener pastures?
4	action	
4	line	Player	Wait a minute! Is there blood on this helmet?
4	line	Black-eye	Erm, no, that's just, erm, paint. Yes, paint! That's what it is!
4	line	Player	Oh, okay. Thanks. Bye.
4	line	Black-eye	Ha, gullible fool.
4	line	Player	What?
4	line	Black-eye	Nothing.
4	action	end
3	option	10 limestone bricks
4	line	Player	10 limestone bricks?
4	line	Black-eye	Guess again, mate.
4	action	end
2	option	A brown rug
3	line	Player	A brown rug?
3	line	Black-eye	Of course, because that's what everyone needs - a rug up at their window.
3	action	end
2	option	Opulent curtains
3	line	Player	Opulent curtains?
3	line	Black-eye	Those curtains are not going to be in any way opulent, matey.
3	action	end
