2	line	Player	What clothes do I need?
2	line	Bonafido	Ya don't seem to be able ta remember anyfin'... Dearie me.
2	line	Bonafido	Come back to me wearin' a hard hat, some scruffy trousers, a good top and some hard boots. Yow shud fand some around 'ere.
2	action	end
1	line	Player	So...
1	line	Bonafido	Like a builder frew and frew! Good job - now it's time to test your skills.
1	line	Player	Okay, what do you want me to build?
1	line	Bonafido	Build?
1	line	Bonafido	Build? Hahaha, don't be a plonka!
1	line	Bonafido	It's not building skills that makes a true builder, you have to have the right mental attitude, yeah?
1	line	Bonafido	Let me see...
1	line	Bonafido	You've plenty of work to do, but you need a drink fast - what do you go for?
1	option	Orange juice
2	line	Player	Orange juice.
2	line	Bonafido	What are you? A healthy builder? Of course, not juice!
2	action	end
1	option	Tea
2	line	Player	Tea.
2	line	Bonafido	Bingo! Ain't nufin' betta.
2	line	Bonafido	Now, let's hear you whistle!
