3	action	Player performs the "dance" emote
3	box	You do a little dance and whistle as loud as you can.
3	line	Bonafido	What on Gielinor are you doing? Get out of my sight.
3	action	end
2	option	Whistle a pretty tune
3	box	You whistle a tune.
