3	line	Bonafido	Wahey! Nice one. Next question.
3	line	Bonafido	What's a good sign that you need to replace your trousers?
3	option	Your legs are getting a bit cold
4	line	Player	Your legs are getting a bit cold?
4	line	Bonafido	Exactamondo! Glad to see you are thinking like a builder.
4	line	Player	I am?
4	line	Bonafido	Yes, obviously if your legs are cold, you lost your trousers altogether!
4	line	Player	That's just what I was thinking.
4	line	Bonafido	Now the last question - what do you do if you cut your finger?
4	option	Cry
5	line	Player	Cry.
5	line	Bonafido	When was the last time you saw a builder cry?
5	action	end
4	option	Carry on, it'll fix itself
5	line	Player	Carry on, it'll fix itself.
5	line	Bonafido	Yep, that's the one!
5	line	Player	Suppose it could get infected then, but that'll just impress the lads all the more.
5	line	Bonafido	Exactly, you're gettin the hang of this quickly!
5	line	Bonafido	Cosmic! I canna see no reason why ya can't go in t'tower now. But be careful, there be some precarious situations in there.
5	line	Player	So, what's left to build?
5	line	Bonafido	Well, there's a pipe system, a pressure machine and a strange cage up at the top that needs finishing off. The alchemists couldn't explain what they were for.
5	line	Player	Thanks!
5	action	end
