0	section	Talking to Bonafido after entering the Tower
1	line	Player	Heya, Bona. I had a look at the building. There's some complex machinery in there! Going to cost someone.
1	line	Bonafido	Yep, told ya so. Any idea what those alchemists are up ta?
1	line	Player	Well, I agree now they're up to something. The question is what...? I don't think we're going to find out much from the alchmists, though.
1	line	Bonafido	So what are you going to do?
1	line	Player	I shall see if I can't fix it up and see for myself what is going on. Should be able to get a good reward from them. But don't worry, I'll make sure your efforts don't go unpaid.
1	line	Bonafido	You're a star among builders, that ya are!
1	action	end
