0	section	Talking to Bonafido
1	line	Player	I'm really getting annoyed with those alchemists.
1	line	Bonafido	Why?
1	line	Player	Well, I completed the tower and I still have no idea what it does, and then as soon as I tell Effigy of my hard work, he doesn't say one word of thanks and legs it off into the tower!
1	line	Bonafido	Well, I'll be a rabbit in da eyes of a fox! Best ya chase after 'im then and get us our dosh! Don't you do a runner, now!
1	line	Player	Don't worry, I'm not about to let Effigy get away with treating us builders like this!
1	action	end
0	section	Going to the top of the tower
1	line	Player	What on Gielinor is...
1	line	Effigy	It is time, my friends! The culmination of our work is complete!
1	line	Transmute	Long time indeed!
1	line	Currency	Many hours we have worked!
1	line	Effigy	A great many years of planning and preparation has brought us here, my fellow alchemists. Now we have... The Tower of Life! We can already create gold, we can already transform matter from one thing to
1	line	Effigy	another, and now we have the ability to create life itself! We owe much to the power of Guthix, for without the life essence he left below ground, we would never have been able to bring this tower alive!
1	line	Player	They're insane!
1	line	Effigy	It begins! The first day of creation!
1	line	Effigy	It worked!
1	line	Currency	Marvellous!
1	line	Player	How is this possible?
1	line	Currency	It's alive!
1	line	Effigy	We did it. A Homunculus!
1	line	Transmute	Beautiful.
1	line	Homunculus	Nwwooo! Whyyy? Where meee? Glarrraaa.
1	line	Transmute	It can talk! A real success.
1	line	Homunculus	Where me? Skin burn...arrgh...eyes hurt...let me go!
1	line	Currency	Excellent, it can feel! It's self-aware. This is really a great day.
1	line	Homunculus	Whyeee cage? Argh...please help me! Graaahhh!
1	line	Player	This is terrible, you must do something!
1	line	Effigy	Ah, it's our helper. Thank you for fixing the tower; we will reward you greatly.
1	line	Player	I don't want a reward, just let it go. Can't you see it's in pain?
1	line	Effigy	Don't worry. It has no soul; it has no worth.
1	line	Transmute	Yes, it's just an experiment in alchemy.
1	line	Currency	The creature must be grateful for his creation.
1	line	Homunculus	You create hurt. Not fair, let me free!
1	line	Currency	Silence, creature!
1	line	Effigy	Yes, be still and quit your moaning.
1	line	Homunculus	No, mean, nasty peoples.
1	line	Effigy	Shut up, you pathetic being.
1	line	Homunculus	Arghh! Let me go!
1	line	Effigy	Don't make us hurt you.
1	line	Player	Stop this! Let it go!
1	line	Homunculus	So horrible beings. Daarrrr!
1	line	Player	It's getting angry.
1	line	Effigy	You should know your place, adventurer. This is no concern of yours now.
1	line	Currency	You should be satisfied and leave. Then we can begin our experiments.
1	line	Player	Not wise.
1	line	Homunculus	Arghhh!
1	line	Effigy	Oh no...
1	line	Transmute	Get out of the tower before it's too late!
1	line	Currency	Run away!
1	line	Effigy	Flee for your lives!
1	line	Player	They've run away. I must go confront those alchemists downstairs.
