0	section	Talking to Bonafido again
1	line	Player	You won't BELIEVE what I just saw!
1	line	Bonafido	What? What?
1	line	Player	That tower is... a tower of life! I just witnessed with my very own eyes the creation of an homunculus!
1	line	Bonafido	A homanque-what?
1	line	Player	Homunculus! They have found a way of creating life itself, but the creature they have made is not a happy being.
1	line	Bonafido	And our money?
1	line	Player	Are you listening at all? This creature is very dangerous, it needs to be stopped! And fast!
1	line	Bonafido	I'm glad you've got the money sorted.
