0	section	Effigy
1	line	Player	Effigy!
1	line	Effigy	I know, I know. This is a truly dangerous creation, of all proportions.
1	line	Player	I hope you learn from this.
1	line	Effigy	I will, I will. Next time we'll use a stronger cage.
1	line	Player	What?
1	line	Effigy	A bad joke.
1	line	Player	I'll just ignore that. So, what about that Homunculus up there? You can't just leave it.
1	line	Effigy	Maybe you could go have a talk with it?
1	line	Player	Why me? You created it!
1	line	Effigy	Pleeeaaase.
1	line	Player	No.
1	line	Effigy	Pretty please with a cherry on top?
1	line	Player	No way!
1	line	Effigy	I'll make sure you're compensated. You won't be forgotten for this!
1	line	Player	Why do I get the feeling I'm doomed to go face that creature on my own?
1	line	Effigy	Good on you! I knew you would help us!
1	line	Player	Oh well. They do say that experience teaches fools.
1	action	end
0	section	Talking to Effigy again
1	line	Player	Hi, Effigy.
1	line	Effigy	Have you spoken to our wondrously fabulous creation yet?
1	line	Player	I haven't spoken to it at all. Give me a chance. And please stop your overuse of adjectives.
1	line	Effigy	What a hideously, unforgiveable and insensitive combination of dialogue to supply to a friend!
1	line	Player	I swear you'll get a knuckle sandwich sometime soon if you don't shut up.
1	line	Effigy	Charming.
1	action	end
