1	line	Transmute	Rather you than me. Can't say you look like you'll make it out alive.
1	line	Player	Thanks for the support. How about saying something encouraging.
1	line	Transmute	Like?
1	line	Player	I don't know. How about 'You can do it!' or 'That Homunculus is in for a surprise'.
1	line	Transmute	So, you want me to lie?
1	line	Player	Forget it.
