0	section	Talking to 'Currency' the Alchemist again
1	line	Player	Okay, I'm going to go chat with the Homunculus.
1	line	Currency	Very good.
1	line	Currency	Could you do us a favour?
1	line	Player	I probably have enough on my plate, but go ahead; what?
1	line	Currency	Could you ask it a question?
