0	section	Effigy
1	line	Player	Effigy, I need a word with you.
1	line	Effigy	You've killed it?
1	line	Player	Not quite...
1	line	Homunculus	Boo.
1	line	Transmute	Oh no, look!
1	line	Currency	Arrghhh! Have mercy!
1	line	Effigy	You set it free. Oh, please don't hurt me!
1	line	Homunculus	Hahaha.
1	line	Homunculus	Me not hurt. Now tell. What you plans? What you do with me?
1	line	Effigy	Please, we just wanted to experiment. We wanted to create life. There's a dungeon under the tower. Long ago we found a strange source of energy that we believe was left behind by the great Guthix. He used to
1	line	Effigy	create life with such ease. We realised we should be able to use this powerful substance, but we needed to bring together our magic along with the logical construction of the builders. It seemed through our experiments that
1	line	Effigy	even magic needs a certain level of rules and laws to work.
1	line	Homunculus	Bad play with. Naughty men. Go! Go, never return!
1	line	Effigy	Right away, right away!
1	line	Homunculus	Me look dungeon, {player}. Please meet there.
1	action	end
